@startuml
!theme mars
autonumber
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

' Definisi Partisipan (Act as Swimlanes)
actor "Superadmin" as Admin
boundary "UI Management User" as UI
control "Auth Service" as System
participant "Casbin (RBAC)" as RBAC
database "DB (Users, Roles, Permissions)" as DB

' ================= FLOW 1: TAMBAH USER & ASSIGN ROLE =================
group 1. Tambah User Baru & Assign Role
    Admin -> UI : 1. Input data (Nama, Email, Password, Pilih Role)
    activate UI
    UI -> System : 2. POST /api/users {data, role_id}
    deactivate UI
    activate System

    System -> System : 3. Validasi format & strength password
    System -> DB : 4. Cek email duplikat (SELECT)
    activate DB
    DB --> System : 5. Return status (unique/duplicate)
    deactivate DB

    alt Email Sudah Ada
        System --> UI : 6. Return error "Email duplikat"
        deactivate System
        activate UI
        UI --> Admin : 7. Tampilkan pesan error
        deactivate UI
    else Email Unik
        System -> System : 8. Hash Password (bcrypt)
        System -> DB : 9. INSERT Users (status=active)
        activate DB
        DB --> System : 10. Return user_id
        deactivate DB

        ' --- LOGIKA ROLE (RBAC) ---
        System -> RBAC : 11. Assign Role (Link User <-> Role)
        activate RBAC
        RBAC -> DB : 12. INSERT CasbinRule (User, Role)
        activate DB
        DB --> RBAC : 13. OK
        deactivate DB
        RBAC --> System : 14. Role assigned
        deactivate RBAC

        System --> UI : 15. Return {success: true}
        deactivate System
        activate UI
        UI --> Admin : 16. Tampilkan "User berhasil dibuat"
        deactivate UI
    end
end

' ================= FLOW 2: CEK IZIN AKSES (PERMISSION CHECK) =================
group 2. Validasi Hak Akses (User Login)
    Admin -> UI : 17. Klik Menu "Kelola Router"
    activate UI
    UI -> System : 18. GET /api/routers (Authorization: Bearer Token)
    deactivate UI
    activate System

    System -> System : 19. Decode Token & Ambil user_id & role

    ' Cek apakah Role ini punya izin untuk akses Router
    System -> RBAC : 20. Enforce(UserID, "router", "read")
    activate RBAC
    RBAC -> DB : 21. Query Policy (Role -> Permission)
    activate DB
    DB --> RBAC : 22. Return (allow/deny)
    deactivate DB
    RBAC --> System : 23. Return true (Allowed)
    deactivate RBAC

    alt Akses Diizinkan
        System -> DB : 24. Query Data Router
        activate DB
        DB --> System : 25. Return list router
        deactivate DB
        System --> UI : 26. Return {data: [...]}
        deactivate System
        activate UI
        UI --> Admin : 27. Tampilkan halaman Router
        deactivate UI
    else Akses Ditolak (403)
        System --> UI : 28. Return 403 Forbidden
        deactivate System
        activate UI
        UI --> Admin : 29. Tampilkan "Akses Ditolak"
        deactivate UI
    end
end

note right of Admin
  * User memiliki 1 atau lebih Role.
  * Role memiliki kumpulan Permissions (izin).
  * Sistem mengecek izin user via Casbin/RBAC sebelum menampilkan data.
  * Admin tidak bisa menghapus user aktif jika masih memiliki role admin utama.
end note

@enduml